  "description": "<p>This area rug offers a blend of inspirational design and practical functionality for various home settings. Featuring a Christian faith floral theme, this rug is crafted to enhance the spiritual and aesthetic atmosphere of any room. It is designed for comfort and durability, making it suitable for daily use in busy areas.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features an inspirational Christian faith floral design.</li>\n<li>Can be personalized with a name or special message.</li>\n<li>Offers a soft and comfortable feel for bare feet.</li>\n<li>Equipped with an anti-slip backing for enhanced safety.</li>\n<li>Suitable for a variety of indoor spaces.</li>\n<li>Resistant to wrinkles and fading for lasting appeal.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Bedroom, Living Room, Office, Gamer Room, Reading Nook, Entryway</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Non-Skid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Floral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Faith</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam, Polyester Fabric</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum for quick cleaning, machine wash for deeper care</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile area rug is ideal for enhancing the ambiance of entryways, bedrooms, living rooms, and offices. It also serves as a thoughtful addition to gamer rooms, cozy reading nooks, meditation areas, and churches, providing both comfort and a decorative touch.</p>",
